# Private working notes — internal strategy, cost modeling, progress logs. Not for the
# public repo. docs/SELF_HOSTING.md/.en.md are the only docs/ files meant to stay public
# (self-hosting guide); everything else here is excluded by name rather than ignoring all
# of docs/, precisely so a new .md added to docs/ is NOT silently private by default.
